b6a62629723"},"notes":"This is all unsupervised! We\u2019re using live data that\u2019s not expertly labeled by operator.\n(Results show a few false positives but no false negatives) -\u00A0Optional talking point\u00A0\n\nWhat was happening: electronics board that was reporting health \u0026 safety of subsystem started to fail such that it changed bits of how it was reporting. So it introduced false jumps in the data. Temperatures should not change that rapidly! \n\nCan say: failure in the onboard circuitry \n\nLooks like some additional dips weren\u2019t flagged\n","role":"source continuation"},{"elements":[{"frame":{"height":0.001,"width":0.001,"x":0,"y":0},"id":"page-ppt-slides-slide18.xml-element-1","index":1,"name":"Content Placeholder 1","nativeRef":{"capabilities":[{"expectedHash":"795a1e1b63537ecb48eb2cf9131d43baecff0b3b72a2500653466ca673ce40a8","fields":["element"],"id":"cap-delete-02569d1270","operation":"delete"},{"expectedHash":"795a1e1b63537ecb48eb2cf9131d43baecff0b3b72a2500653466ca673ce40a8","fields":["zOrder"],"id":"cap-reorder-2f902ab177","operation":"reorder"},{"expectedHash":"795a1e1b63537ecb48eb2cf9131d43baecff0b3b72a2500653466ca673ce40a8","fields":["hidden"],"id":"cap-setHidden-1fdda268c7","operation":"setHidden"},{"expectedHash":"795a1e1b63537ecb48eb2cf9131d43baecff0b3b72a2500653466ca673ce40a8","fields":["locked"],"id":"cap-setLocked-eb20e167fc","operation":"setLocked"}],"capabilitySetSha256":"b47f9127d6c04783de03566b4e2e5c75fa7693b951873380bb2a679c86f972dd","handle":"nr-a4b07180052c78873f622c473252738ba2ad081abae580c946c9d192ef65b7b5","leaves":[{"expectedHash":"6e28105f723cc6dec38c4a2dfb565ed0f416f434d55fe9a414f91361bbe9a14c","id":"nl_a8286f022603643cae43345f43ded536","kind":"text","value":"Experiment with variations of the model architecture"},{"expectedHash":"5c49f88dafe66e0ecdca8f682ae0b38c38ccd3ad464e3358e899beca88c18560","id":"nl_a56035b9773190182f37ad1756e52b78","kind":"fontLanguage","value":"en-US"},{"expectedHash":"7509c5ddb6034b145ad5f